{
  "id": 1251,
  "description": "Rejoice, for you finally witness the ⚜️ Imperium of Man ⚜️.\n\nA divine empire without equal, stretching from one end of the galaxy to the other, its banners aflame with gold and sacred scripture. Upon the Golden Throne sits the God-Emperor of Mankind, immortal, omnipotent, a blazing star that guides humanity through the endless universes. Every heartbeat of the Imperium is a prayer. Every war, a holy crusade.\n\nPlanet-sized forges roar in His name. Cathedral worlds ring with hymns sung by billions. Star-fleets like moving continents of steel tear reality apart as they make war in the heavens. From the skies descend his army, demi-gods in ceramite, the Emperor’s wrath given form, their arrival the sound of destiny itself.\n\nHumanity does not endure — it conquers. It does not hope — it believes. A trillion souls stand unbroken, united by faith, sacrifice, and glorious, eternal war.\n\nGlory to the Emperor ! Glory to mankind eternal !! Forever !!!\n\n⚜️ Benefits ⚜️\n\nDaily Raids and Pool Buff in the future.\n\nWeekly Premium Membership giveaways.\n\nConsumable Sponsorship (for ultra activer players)\n\nHelpful community.\n\nGuidance Scrolls Living Vending Machine (might be broken sometimes)\n\n⚜️ Rules ⚜️\n\nOnline Inactivity for 3 days period without notice will result in a kick.\n\nGuild Activity (Raid/Contribution/Challenge) should be performed daily.\n\nFormer members may freely re-apply in the future.\n\n⚜️ RAID TIMES ⚜️\n\nRaids usually start at 4:00 UTC and repeat for 3 times one right after another.\n\n⚜️ Communications ⚜️\n\nDiscord - https://discord.gg/p3jzCnEswm (for raid/shooting star pings and giveaways.)",
